{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34263","headline":"五歌 放牛 · 陆龟蒙","name":"五歌 放牛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江草秋穷似秋半，十角吴牛放江岸。\n邻肩抵尾乍依隈，横去斜奔忽分散。\n荒陂断堑无端入，背上时时孤鸟立。\n日暮相将带雨归，田家烟火微茫湿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}